This is the git repository for the Coulomb-excitation code gosia. It is based on the original code of Tomasz Czosnyka ([homepage](https://www.pas.rochester.edu/~cline/Gosia/)).  
gosia is not to be confused with gosia2.

## Documentation
Many information can be found in the gosia [wiki](https://www-user.pas.rochester.edu/~gosia/mediawiki/index.php/Main_Page).
A list of functions contained in gosia can be found in the [list_of_functions.txt](list_of_functions.txt).

## Build
Note that in the git tree, the code is split into separate files for each function. These are combined using  
```bash
cd src
make single_file
```
Afterwards gosia can be compiled in the `src` directory with
```bash
g77 gosia_${version}.f -o gosia
```
or
```bash
gfortran gosia_${version}.f -o gosia
```

